ard are like holding a tsunami back  with a sand castle labour have suggested  that we apply a windfall tax to oil and  gas firms who are raking in record  profits at the moment in the words of  one  chief executive of an oil company they  said they have more money than they knew  what to do with that is an affront to  families across this country  i know exactly  exactly when people are as you say  genuinely worrying about cutting back  the essentials thinking about how they  get to work how they feed their families  how they heat their homes and at the  moment the tories are siding with those  oil and gas firms rather than struggling  people across this country good to talk  to you thanks for taking the time thank  you
 

